  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n### \ud83d\udcde HR Phone Numbers:\n- **540-362-4911** \u2013 The primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n- **1-800-380-4681** \u2013 The HR Support Center number, as shared by Advance Auto Parts officially.\n\n### \ud83d\udce7 HR Email:\n- **HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com** \u2013 You can also reach the HR Support Center via email.\n\n### \ud83d\udd50 HR Hours:\n- When contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips:\n- For optimal service and shorter wait times, it is recommended to call at around **11:30 AM**, as this time frame tends to have less call volume.\n- Calling the HR number can help with matters such as **job applications, employee benefits, interview scheduling, and workplace policies.**\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f *Phone numbers can change over time. If you have trouble reaching HR, visit the official Advance Auto Parts website at **advanceautoparts.com** for the most up-to-date contact information.*",
